  "about.title": "About OpenMind",
  "about.mission": "Every student, regardless of country or income, should have access to the same quality of learning support as the world's most privileged students. OpenMind is free, open-source infrastructure for that mission: the curriculum, the tutor, the diagnostics and the network.",
  "about.license": "MIT-licensed. Fork it, translate it, run it on a school server, put your ministry's name on a deployment.",
  "about.contribute": "Contribute: lessons, questions, translations and misconception patterns are plain data files — your first pull request can teach someone to read.",
